      "transcriptHtml": "\n<div>\n<h4>\n<i></i> Lời thoại bài nghe (Audio Tapescript &amp; Dẫn chứng chi tiết)\n              </h4>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Task 1 Script -->\n<div>\n<p>Task 1: Tom and Linda talking about community activities</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> So, what did your club do <span>last year</span>? <em>[Dẫn chứng Câu 1 $\\rightarrow$ A]</em></p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> We tutored 3rd grade children and helped old people.</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Fantastic! What did you tutor?</p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> We taught <span>English and maths</span>. <em>[Dẫn chứng Câu 2 $\\rightarrow$ B]</em></p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Awesome! Was it difficult?</p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> Yes. But we had a lot of fun.</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> I see! How did you help the elderly?</p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> We <span>cooked for them</span> and did some cleaning, too. <em>[Dẫn chứng Câu 3 $\\rightarrow$ B]</em></p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Great! I'm sure they benefited from it.</p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> Thanks! It made us feel useful. How about you?</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> We picked up <span>paper and bottles</span> in a nearby park. <em>[Dẫn chứng Câu 4 $\\rightarrow$ B]</em> We also <span>planted some trees</span>. <em>[Dẫn chứng Câu 5 $\\rightarrow$ A]</em></p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> Fabulous! Did you water them too?</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Sure. We watered them very often the first few weeks and enjoyed watching them grow.</p>\n<p><strong>Linda:</strong> Glad to hear it, Tom.</p>\n<p><strong>Tom:</strong> Yes. It was <span>a really good time</span>. We worked and played together, and we learnt some skills, too. <em>[Dẫn chứng Câu 6 $\\rightarrow$ B: a happy time]</em></p>\n</div>\n<!-- Task 2 Script -->\n<div>\n<p>Task 2: Julia talking about her hobby</p>\n<p>Hello, My name is Julia. <span>My favourite pastime is taking photographs</span>. <em>[Dẫn chứng TF1 $\\rightarrow$ True]</em></p>\n<p>On my eleventh birthday, <span>my dad</span> gave me a camera and showed me how to take a picture of my birthday cake. <em>[Dẫn chứng TF2: Bố tặng máy ảnh chứ không phải mẹ $\\rightarrow$ False]</em></p>\n<p>It was amazing! Since then I have been very keen on doing it. I have to go to school every weekday, so <span>I only have time for my hobby at the weekend</span>. <em>[Dẫn chứng TF3: Chỉ có thời gian cuối tuần chứ không phải mỗi ngày $\\rightarrow$ False]</em></p>\n<p><span>I always get up early on Saturday morning</span> and then I go to the beach to take pictures of beautiful sunrises. <em>[Dẫn chứng TF4 $\\rightarrow$ True]</em></p>\n<p>After that, <span>I go to the park to take photos of the flowers there</span>. They look fresh in the morning. <em>[Dẫn chứng TF5 $\\rightarrow$ True]</em></p>\n<p><span>I only show my photos to my parents, not anyone else</span>. <em>[Dẫn chứng TF6: Chỉ cho bố mẹ xem chứ không phải mọi người $\\rightarrow$ False]</em></p>\n<p>I hope I will be a famous photographer in the future.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
